{
  "description": "Gate E.8 payables vectors (plan §8): bill and payment states, instructable amounts, and the supplier ledger arithmetic (approved bills − credit notes − settled payments). Settlement and credit notes do not exist in this wave (owner decision E-18); their arithmetic is still pinned so the E-18 slice inherits a checked rule. Checked by payables.test.ts.",
